      "title": "What to download / where to put it",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Repair the left/right seam of a 360 panorama - FLUX.2 Klein 9B\n\nTurns the panorama by 180 degrees, paints the area behind the camera (middle 34 %) green, lets Klein fill it,\nkeeps the original everywhere else (soft edge), turns it back. For any 2:1 panorama, e.g. MiniMax H3 image or P-H3 image outputs.\n\n## Models (in `ComfyUI/models/`)\n| File | Folder |\n|---|---|\n| [flux-2-klein-9b-fp8.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-9b-fp8/blob/main/flux-2-klein-9b-fp8.safetensors) | `diffusion_models/` |\n| [qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Flux-2-Klein-9B/blob/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors) | `text_encoders/` |\n| [flux2-vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Flux-2-Klein-9B/blob/main/split_files/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors) | `vae/` |\n| [flux-2-klein-9B-360-erp-outpaint-lora_V1.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/nomadoor/flux-2-klein-9B-360-erp-outpaint-lora/blob/main/flux-2-klein-9B-360-erp-outpaint-lora_V1.safetensors) | `loras/` |\n\n## Custom nodes (in `ComfyUI/custom_nodes/`)\n- **ComfyUI-Pano360** (180 degree roll): https://github.com/shisa84/ComfyUI-Pano360\n- **ComfyUI-KJNodes** (soft mask edge): https://github.com/kijai/ComfyUI-KJNodes\n\n## Settings to adapt\n- **Panorama**: load a 2:1 image. The result is scaled back to the original size (from the Get Image Size node).\n- **Style only**: materials, colours, light, no furniture words. **Back**: \"The green area is ...\" = what should be behind the camera.\n- Tested on four H3 / P-H3 images: seam correlation from -0.2..0.65 to 0.84..0.97, about 25 s each.\n- A slight tone difference can remain at the band edges; change the seed or widen the soft edge.\n"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
